{
  "id": "E372",
  "title": "Playing Video Games",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-11-09",
  "synopsis": "Paul has finally got his new game console. Little Le is not impressed… or is she?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50372/e4ec8ac712d0e0cb85cb58e46c0b019041db74fd.mp3?1572261885",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "真是太好玩了\n\n保罗：我的新游戏机终于到了！\n小乐：我记得你好像上个月就买了啊，怎么才送到？\n保罗：你不知道，这个游戏机现在特别火。官网总是断货。\n小乐：好吧。不就是个游戏机吗？有那么好玩吗？\n保罗：你来玩一下就知道了。\n（半小时后）\n小乐：这个游戏机太好玩了！我也要买一个。",
    "traditional": "真是太好玩了\n\n保羅：我的新遊戲機終於到了！\n小樂：我記得你好像上個月就買了啊，怎麼才送到？\n保羅：你不知道，這個遊戲機現在特別火。官網總是斷貨。\n小樂：好吧。不就是個遊戲機嗎？有那麼好玩嗎？\n保羅：你來玩一下就知道了。\n（半小時後）\n小樂：這個遊戲機太好玩了！我也要買一個。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It was so much fun"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "保罗：我的新游戏机终于到了！",
      "traditional": "保羅：我的新遊戲機終於到了！",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wǒ de xīn yóu xì jī zhōng yú dào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: My new game console is finally here!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：我记得你好像上个月就买了啊，怎么才送到？",
      "traditional": "小樂：我記得你好像上個月就買了啊，怎麼才送到？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ jì de nǐ hǎo xiàng shàng ge yuè jiù mǎi le a zěn me cái sòng dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: I remember it as you buying it last month, how come it wasn’t delivered until now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：你不知道，这个游戏机现在特别火。官网总是断货。",
      "traditional": "保羅：你不知道，這個遊戲機現在特別火。官網總是斷貨。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nǐ bù zhī dào zhè ge yóu xì jī xiàn zài tè bié huǒ guān wǎng zǒng shì duàn huò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: You have no idea. This game console is super popular right now. It’s always out-of-stock on the official website."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：好吧。不就是个游戏机吗？有那么好玩吗？",
      "traditional": "小樂：好吧。不就是個遊戲機嗎？有那麼好玩嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hǎo ba bú jiù shì ge yóu xì jī ma yǒu nà me hǎo wán ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Fine. Isn’t it just a game console? Could it be that fun?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗：你来玩一下就知道了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：你來玩一下就知道了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nǐ lái wán yí xià jiù zhī dào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: You’ll know when you have played some."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "（半小时后）",
      "traditional": "（半小時後）",
      "pinyin": "bàn xiǎo shí hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(Half an hour later)"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小乐：这个游戏机太好玩了！我也要买一个。",
      "traditional": "小樂：這個遊戲機太好玩了！我也要買一個。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè zhè ge yóu xì jī tài hǎo wán le wǒ yě yào mǎi yí ge",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: This game console is amazing! I also want to buy one."
    }
  ],
